{"ID":"20240522082242-igbjmfy","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082242-igbjmfy","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082242-igbjmfy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522095637-vz3lvru\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522095637-kfol4l2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:809,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522095637-krqu1bk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"陈杰宽的肝癌案例","type":"doc","updated":"20240522095648"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095637-vz3lvru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-vz3lvru","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"陈杰宽的肝癌案例"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-yeer2mz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-yeer2mz","updated":"20240522095637"}},{"ID":"20240522095637-b3svkwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-b3svkwa","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008年6月17日."}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-gjd16dh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-gjd16dh","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F.C C. 女性,查出肝癌四周,因怕西医的治疗,故来找我治疗."}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-h58xj4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-h58xj4f","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"症状： 肝区和胃脘刺痛，腰痛, 膝痛，胃口很差,欲呕吐, 老觉得有物塞住胃,食欲极差。怕冷,大便难，失眠，很难入睡。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-qblshd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-qblshd0","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人有糖尿病五年,一直服西医治疗。（是否食糖尿病的药引起的癌症呢？怕是有这个可能性）"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-7ulmq1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-7ulmq1j","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉诊：双关尺附骨脉."}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-iyl4yf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-iyl4yf9","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹诊：肝下有硬块,硬实，痛,形成以肝区为底面的16厘米左右的不规则的等边三角形.压之痛加重。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-30lkiy6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-30lkiy6","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诊断：厥阴阴实。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-od7iea2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-od7iea2","updated":"20240522095637"}},{"ID":"20240522095637-1o83865","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-1o83865","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方："}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-zltxuyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-zltxuyt","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实脾的四君子合倪师的常用治肝四宝（柴郁胆芩）加补北的补骨纸，去实的牡蛎，去阴寒的生附干姜"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-niacvxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-niacvxj","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"七天药。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-3sxxxit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-3sxxxit","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008年6月24日，第二诊，胃肝疼痛已经控制不痛了,胃口好,能睡,肿块小了60%左右。病情好转的迅速，超出想象，可见经方的威力之大。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-pazeey7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-pazeey7","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"效不更方，上方再服一周."}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-80c3jkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-80c3jkt","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之后不再见病人诊治。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-zbelef5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-zbelef5","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一年之后"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-z07kzqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-z07kzqh","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2009-6-2"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-i1loc7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-i1loc7b","updated":"20240522095637"}},{"ID":"20240522095637-2v1w0cz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-2v1w0cz","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人陪她的丈夫来看病,告诉我服了最后一次的药后,肿块已经不见了,故一直无再来诊。睡眠，胃口，体力一直很好。也没有再服糖尿病的药了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-s6597bh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-s6597bh","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"几点说明："}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-wm326s4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-wm326s4","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一：这个病人坚信中医是唯一可以帮助她的，一念就改变了她的命运。不似现在大部份的人先行做了手术化放疗，最后不成了，才找中医治疗。到了最后的死期限了，往往还会提出过份的要求：例如常常问中医：“我的癌症什么时候会治好呀？”"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-g5txtcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-g5txtcn","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二：证明倪师传的经方的威力之强大，故倪师一直强调经方是佛法的医学，所言非虚，因为只有佛法的医学才能解危于生死之间。弟子深有体会。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-zjute0b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-zjute0b","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三：证明倪师的无私传授是何其伟大。非常人能做到。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-sro3e9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-sro3e9e","updated":"20240522095637"}},{"ID":"20240522095637-11s55t3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-11s55t3","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生  杰宽报告上"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-14v0cex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-14v0cex","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2009年6月9日"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-0q8b2ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-0q8b2ez","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-krqu1bk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-krqu1bk","updated":"20240522095648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-gg22lsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-gg22lsx","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   杰寬是我的優秀學生之一，是一位在紐西蘭開業的中醫師，除了專精於經方醫學之外，也是一位超級優秀的廚師，畢業於廣州中醫藥大學，在桃花島跟診時，幾乎所有同學都嚐過他煮的好菜，這事至今仍被同學們津津樂道，這個肝癌案例會成功，主要的原因 除了杰寬的正確施治就是病人絕對的信任中醫學，同時又沒有給西醫先治療過，從一開始就找中醫來治，這種病只要給西醫先治療過，就一定無救了。在台灣已經有幾位西醫所謂的肝癌專家，自己卻都死於肝癌，這已經證明西醫學是無法治療肝癌的，讀者們一定要記住，只要肝區出現腫瘤時，請立刻找中醫來治療，如果服藥二週後沒有改善，請立刻換醫師，同時也請無法治療肝癌的醫師，不要耽誤病人的病情，一旦病情被延誤，就會不治，杰寬很優秀啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095637-kfol4l2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095637-kfol4l2","updated":"20240522095637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]}]}